{"type":"text","timestamp":1794255123866,"sessionID":"ses_e3e123a70ffeIz63RPC4QLko1l","part":{"id":"prt_1c1f07580001pUk7qATE2ZprGC","messageID":"msg_1c1f05fda0013O1YYd4zzY6x5G","sessionID":"ses_e3e123a70ffeIz63RPC4QLko1l","type":"text","text":"The store finder is built, but I haven't built the Docker image or run the frontend in a browser. Docker isn't available in this sandbox.\n\n- **Backend checks:** I ran the API through Flask's test client. The checks were nearby search with `distance_km`, a validation error on add, and an update that clears an omitted `phone`. I also checked a missing token (401), a non-admin token (403), and a delete by the admin (204). The 8 sample stores are seeded on first start.\n- **Frontend checks:** `npm run typecheck` and `npm run build` both pass.\n- **Admin password:** `ADMIN_PASSWORD` must be set when the app starts, or admin sign-in is disabled. Run the container with `-e ADMIN_PASSWORD=...`.\n- **Where things are:** the API is in `backend/app.py` and the data in `data/stores.db`. The frontend is in `frontend/src/`, with Tailwind added in `frontend/src/index.css`.\n- **Error and token details:**\n  - Errors come back as `{\"error\": ..., \"details\": {field: message}}`, and the add/edit forms show the per-field messages.\n  - Login tokens are stored hashed and expire after 7 days.\n  - Admin tokens are cleared on every restart.\n- **Radius default:** if `lat` and `lng` are given without `radius`, it defaults to 25 km. The page's radius selector offers 1 to 500 km.\n\nI added a `.gitignore` for `node_modules`, `frontend/dist`, `data/` and `__pycache__`, and a `typecheck` script in `frontend/package.json`. I also added `tailwindcss`, `@tailwindcss/vite`, `typescript` and the React type packages to `frontend/package.json` and its lock file.","time":{"start":1794255123840,"end":1794255123845}}}
